1
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:04,200
Andaman, Andaman,

2
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:06,760
Andaman, Andaman,

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,920
Andaman, Andaman,

4
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:12,680
Andaman, Andaman, Andaman.

5
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:32,560
Hey, sir!

6
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:34,200
Sir!

7
00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:36,120
Sir!

8
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:39,080
Sir! Sir!

9
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:41,240
This is considered

10
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:42,680
today's most shocking event.

11
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:45,160
Actor Anda, who made his debut

12
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:46,000
in a sensational series,

13
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:46,800
was found dead

14
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:48,920
inside a private vehicle.

15
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:50,360
Authorities speculate that

16
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:51,960
stress from public criticism

17
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,800
may have been a contributing factor

18
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,880
that pushed him over the edge.

19
00:02:29,720 --> 00:02:33,760
[One month earlier]

20
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:39,079
Podduang.

21
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:43,600
Podduang.

22
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:46,640
Podduang

23
00:02:50,160 --> 00:02:51,640
You're finally awake, Sleeping Beauty.

24
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:53,560
Or do I have to give you a kiss, too?

25
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:59,360
What the hell are you playing at?

26
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:02,560
You're sleeping like there's no tomorrow.

27
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:03,920
Come on. Get up already.

28
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:06,040
How did you get in?

29
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:07,240
What a question.

30
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:09,360
We were roommates for two years.

31
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:11,200
In your third year, you moved to a condo.

32
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,760
Did you forget your ex already?

33
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:13,440
Huh?

34
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:14,960
Come on!

35
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:19,400
What is that sound?

36
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,680
The sound of hunger.

37
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:21,840
Quick!

38
00:03:23,760 --> 00:03:27,160
[Andaman]

39
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:29,880
[Fan Club]

40
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:32,160
[The Field of Love]
[Dorm Mate]

41
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:39,400
Smells wonderful.

42
00:03:43,760 --> 00:03:45,079
I'm starving.

43
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:47,040
Bumm.

44
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:49,240
What makes you this hungry?

45
00:03:49,760 --> 00:03:50,800
Well, last night,

46
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:52,760
a guitarist at my brother's place got sick,

47
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:54,840
so I was called in
as a substitute until 3 A.M.

48
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:57,600
After I got up, Dunk dragged me here.

49
00:03:57,880 --> 00:03:59,079
Why wouldn't I be hungry?

50
00:03:59,079 --> 00:04:01,400
What? We have to make preparations, don't we?

51
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,600
The freshman orientation is over soon.

52
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:04,680
I'm already a third-year,
but the freshmen still haven't met me.

53
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:07,760
We have to be the mean seniors, right?

54
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:10,080
We're on the entertainment team.

55
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:13,240
So feel free to act all tough and cool
in front of the freshmen yourself.

56
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:15,120
I don't want them to hate me.

57
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:17,360
They'll surely like me, right, Podduang?

58
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:18,480
Mm.

59
00:04:18,519 --> 00:04:20,040
You're the most handsome guy.

60
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,440
Don't agree with him, Podduang.

61
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:22,880
Dunk is full of himself.

62
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:28,480
Which one is better?

63
00:04:28,840 --> 00:04:29,560
Let me see.

64
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:31,120
- What are you doing?
- This.

65
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:32,159
This one, this one.

66
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:34,760
It's about that Anda guy again?

67
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,200
Take that back!

68
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:38,360
How dare you address him like that?

69
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:40,760
What? My bad, alright?

70
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:42,120
Enjoy yourselves, you two.

71
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,920
I'll go watch
the soccer highlights while I wait.

72
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:50,320
Aww, I'm so happy.

73
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:52,920
After two years of waiting,
Anda finally got cast as the lead pair.

74
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:55,520
Plus, he hits number one
on trending every week.

75
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:57,320
The agency must've acknowledged his potential.

76
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:59,400
Yeah, how fabulous.

77
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:01,640
You hyped up the trend, didn't you?

78
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:03,320
Nosy!

79
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:04,240
Podduang!

80
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:06,480
- She said I'm being nosy.
- Well, you are.

81
00:05:06,760 --> 00:05:09,640
It's absolutely red-hot right now,

82
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:10,600
Dunk, louder.

83
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:13,840
- Anda and James's ship trend...
- Dunk, stop!

84
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:15,840
What? What exactly do you want me to do?

85
00:05:15,880 --> 00:05:17,080
We're telling you to stop!

86
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:20,080
- Hello, James, Anda.
- Don't switch the channel just yet.

87
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:21,520
- Hi.
- Hello, hello.

88
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:24,840
Is there anything you want to tell the fans
who are waiting for this series?

89
00:05:25,280 --> 00:05:26,720
Anda, you go first.
Let me hold the mic for you.

90
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:30,440
Well, please look forward to it,
my lovely Andaman fandom.

91
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:32,520
- Anda is so adorable.
- You're so right.

92
00:05:32,520 --> 00:05:34,000
Aww, he's so cute in that look!

93
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:36,120
- We put so much into this series.
- Yeah, agreed.

94
00:05:36,159 --> 00:05:37,440
Yes, because...

95
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:40,000
this project has gone through
so much just to get here.

96
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:41,240
Everyone worked really hard.

97
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:42,880
He's the number one in my book.

98
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:44,920
Yeah, he's so cute.

99
00:05:46,159 --> 00:05:48,000
Our first and second series
were extremely well received.

100
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:48,480
Yeah, yeah.

101
00:05:48,520 --> 00:05:51,040
And I hope you're looking forward
to this one as well.

102
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:53,320
So proud of him.

103
00:05:53,760 --> 00:05:54,600
My boy.

104
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:56,880
Come on.
Let's prepare for the orientation.

105
00:06:05,400 --> 00:06:08,800
[Welcome to
the Sports and Health Science Family]

106
00:06:08,840 --> 00:06:10,880
[First Year]

107
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:16,640
[Ready to Roll]

108
00:06:29,200 --> 00:06:30,520
Are you all having a good time here?!

109
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:34,200
I guess not.

110
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:36,360
This year,

111
00:06:36,680 --> 00:06:38,680
the Faculty of Sports and Health Science

112
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:42,120
has the lowest orientation turnout.

113
00:06:43,159 --> 00:06:44,480
Why is that?!

114
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:46,920
Where are all your friends?!

115
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:49,320
Everyone, stand up!

116
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:51,400
Hey, quickly!

117
00:06:53,159 --> 00:06:54,680
Pick up the pace if you're one of us!

118
00:06:57,159 --> 00:06:59,920
What I want to tell all of you is this:

119
00:07:00,520 --> 00:07:01,680
We're all brothers and sisters

120
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:04,040
in this faculty.

121
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,280
We're one big family,

122
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:08,000
and by that, we truly mean it.

123
00:07:09,760 --> 00:07:10,800
This means that,

124
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:13,320
starting right now,

125
00:07:14,400 --> 00:07:15,760
I want everyone

126
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:20,040
to enjoy this moment with me.

127
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,960
Oh, come on.

128
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:29,280
You pulled off the act so seamlessly.

129
00:07:29,280 --> 00:07:30,440
How come you couldn't tell?

130
00:07:30,440 --> 00:07:32,000
- My outfit clearly gave it away.
- Dunk, Dunk.

131
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,120
Can I take a video of you?

132
00:07:33,159 --> 00:07:35,280
I'm gonna shout,
"Why are you wearing a suit, Boss?!"

133
00:07:35,320 --> 00:07:36,920
- Do a cool pose, okay?
- Alright.

134
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:38,120
- Yeah, okay.
- Ready?

135
00:07:38,159 --> 00:07:39,440
Three, two, one!

136
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:42,760
So...

137
00:07:43,280 --> 00:07:44,640
Bumm, my beautiful senior,

138
00:07:45,280 --> 00:07:47,880
I want you to be my older fraternity sister.

139
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:50,240
Should I be happy with the word "older"?

140
00:07:50,520 --> 00:07:52,560
Oh, it was just a joke.

141
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:54,560
Podduang, can I have your autograph?

142
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:55,680
Absolutely.

143
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:57,880
Are you taken?

144
00:07:59,280 --> 00:08:01,280
Wow.

145
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,160
"Are you taken?"

146
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:06,160
Right? Are you?

147
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:09,080
Like, is he usually...

148
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:10,480
this much of a goofball?

149
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:12,880
Always. It's his character.

150
00:08:15,200 --> 00:08:17,200
Alright. Everyone is here, correct?

151
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:19,400
Allow me to officially make
this announcement again.

152
00:08:19,880 --> 00:08:22,320
A lot has changed nowadays.

153
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:25,000
This year's orientation requires
none of the drills

154
00:08:25,200 --> 00:08:26,760
or usual traditions.

155
00:08:27,520 --> 00:08:29,160
The seniors voted to make orientation

156
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:31,040
more about getting to know each other.

157
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,960
There's another thing you should know.

158
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:36,760
This year, there won't be

159
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,679
Faculty Queen and King,

160
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:41,520
even though we used to have

161
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,159
our Faculty Queen

162
00:08:43,760 --> 00:08:44,840
and our freaking Faculty King.

163
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:49,600
I think you two look like a couple.

164
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:52,120
Is there something going on?

165
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,320
Don't get flustered now.

166
00:08:54,400 --> 00:08:56,120
Should we go back to the old way, huh?

167
00:08:57,160 --> 00:08:58,160
Right, right.

168
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:00,120
Let's get back on track.

169
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:03,200
Tomorrow night is
the final day of the orientation.

170
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:05,680
We want all of you here at 7 P.M. sharp.

171
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:07,360
We have something for you.

172
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:10,640
That's it for today.

173
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:22,960
[Kensan]

174
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:24,960
By the way, Podduang,

175
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:26,720
how's your brother?

176
00:09:27,160 --> 00:09:29,600
I heard he attended
the Faculty of Engineering's orientation.

177
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:31,280
Satang did not.

178
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:34,880
I think he has to go practice

179
00:09:35,520 --> 00:09:36,600
with the youth squad.

180
00:09:36,760 --> 00:09:38,040
He really is that good.

181
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:41,840
Don't you feel lonely living alone?

182
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:43,600
Why?

183
00:09:44,160 --> 00:09:45,520
Asking like you wanna move in or something.

184
00:09:45,560 --> 00:09:48,200
I'd rather not. I'm afraid of heights.

185
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:52,000
Jeez, you've been with me
since freshman year.

186
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,720
This is the first time you've told me.

187
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:56,600
What? Your old place was only four stories.

188
00:09:57,040 --> 00:09:58,360
Your condo has way more floors.

189
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:02,120
Dunk, my room is on the third floor.

190
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:09,720
I know. I was just joking.

191
00:10:10,400 --> 00:10:11,560
There, there.

192
00:10:12,520 --> 00:10:14,040
Gosh, that tickles.

193
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:21,560
Here. I know it's your favorite.

194
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:24,400
Excellent. You know me so well.

195
00:10:26,760 --> 00:10:28,480
- Oh, Podduang.
- Huh?

196
00:10:28,920 --> 00:10:30,520
Anda's filming for the faculty this Saturday.

197
00:10:30,520 --> 00:10:31,160
Wanna go?

198
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:32,560
Of course.

199
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:34,080
As members of Andaman fandom,

200
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:35,360
we can't miss this.

201
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:38,520
Aren't you afraid to meet your bestie?

202
00:10:39,640 --> 00:10:40,600
Who?

203
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:42,080
Jinna, obviously.

204
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:44,840
- Dunk, give it back to me.
- Hey, I was kidding!

205
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:46,160
- Give it back!
- I was joking.

206
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:49,160
- Come on!
- No, no. I'm sorry.

207
00:10:49,160 --> 00:10:50,680
Why do you hate him this much?

208
00:10:51,160 --> 00:10:52,280
Come on, Bumm...

209
00:10:52,280 --> 00:10:53,360
you forgot it all already?

210
00:10:53,560 --> 00:10:56,480
Jinna and his friends
always practiced on our field as freshmen.

211
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:58,480
They never took care of the place either.

212
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:01,160
- And that guy always messed with me.
- Right.

213
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:03,640
Yeah, and he's always a poser.

214
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,960
Jinna, or you?

215
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:08,920
Jinna, of course!

216
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,160
I think it's you.

217
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:13,360
Hey, what's that?

218
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,640
- Huh?
- Look.

219
00:11:16,680 --> 00:11:17,280
Hey!

220
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:18,920
That's my meatball!

221
00:11:18,920 --> 00:11:20,160
Please, please, please.

222
00:11:20,920 --> 00:11:21,760
Hey!

223
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,000
Hey...

224
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:24,240
You can't have it.

225
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,320
Please...

226
00:11:28,440 --> 00:11:29,720
- Hey!
- It's mine.

227
00:11:29,760 --> 00:11:31,240
Hey, please.

228
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:32,200
Just one.

229
00:11:32,560 --> 00:11:33,680
This one will do.

230
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:40,880
I'm stuffed.

231
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:44,760
How are you getting back to your place?

232
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:47,120
- Mm...
- Uh...

233
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:49,720
I think I'm gonna walk that way.

234
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:52,080
Yeah, same.

235
00:11:52,160 --> 00:11:53,760
I'm gonna stop by my brother's place first.

236
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:57,480
What about you?

237
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:02,240
I've called a ride. It should be here soon.

238
00:12:03,560 --> 00:12:05,280
You two go ahead.

239
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:08,600
Okay, I'll get going, then.

240
00:12:08,920 --> 00:12:09,720
Mm.

241
00:12:09,920 --> 00:12:11,160
Yeah, get home safe.

242
00:12:14,760 --> 00:12:16,040
Take care of the bills, okay?

243
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:17,480
Again, Dunk?!

244
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:18,920
- See you.
- Bye-bye.

245
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:20,080
Bye-bye, Bumm.

246
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:43,400
[Faculty of Engineering]

247
00:12:51,320 --> 00:12:52,600
Oh! I'm sorry.

248
00:13:01,040 --> 00:13:02,280
The path is pretty wide.

249
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:03,720
Did you do that on purpose?

250
00:13:17,880 --> 00:13:19,120
Who were you talking to?

251
00:13:21,280 --> 00:13:22,200
Never mind.

252
00:13:30,160 --> 00:13:31,280
- You know them yet?
- Got any alcohol?

253
00:13:32,160 --> 00:13:33,600
- No, right?
- Introduce me to them.

254
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:36,960
Oh, it's our Faculty Queen and King.

255
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:38,080
- Took you forever.
- Good evening.

256
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:38,880
Good evening.

257
00:13:38,920 --> 00:13:39,840
Podduang.

258
00:13:41,520 --> 00:13:42,720
What took you so long?

259
00:13:55,400 --> 00:13:56,920
Right, Golf.

260
00:13:56,920 --> 00:13:58,280
Nice.

261
00:13:59,280 --> 00:14:00,600
Nut.

262
00:14:03,160 --> 00:14:04,520
Put your wristband on already. Come on.

263
00:14:04,560 --> 00:14:06,280
- Jeez, I'm about to.
- It's on.

264
00:14:06,280 --> 00:14:07,440
- Come on.
- You don't drink?

265
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:09,480
I do, but not alcohol.

266
00:14:10,080 --> 00:14:12,080
Hmm, I know...

267
00:14:12,120 --> 00:14:14,920
you're having an after-party here.

268
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:18,200
Podduang, I know you've got
the slushy in your cup.

269
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:20,120
These freshmen know too much.

270
00:14:20,640 --> 00:14:22,160
How about a toast, Bro?!

271
00:14:22,160 --> 00:14:25,000
Not inviting your ship partner
to sit with you?

272
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:26,920
Shit,

273
00:14:27,160 --> 00:14:28,400
if Bumm hears you say that,

274
00:14:28,400 --> 00:14:29,480
you're dead.

275
00:14:29,520 --> 00:14:31,520
Well, you two actually suit each other!

276
00:14:34,040 --> 00:14:34,640
Bumm,

277
00:14:35,040 --> 00:14:36,800
can you play a song for Dunk?

278
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:43,760
You're all pushing your luck tonight.

279
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:45,280
The Queen is coming.

280
00:14:45,640 --> 00:14:47,200
Things are about to go down.

281
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:48,600
I'm scared.

282
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:51,960
Have a seat here.

283
00:14:53,280 --> 00:14:54,400
This group...

284
00:14:54,960 --> 00:14:56,040
is pure trouble.

285
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:58,280
I'll have Dunk put you all
on the soccer team.

286
00:14:58,320 --> 00:15:00,200
Oh, bring it on!

287
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:02,560
- I'm the real deal. Just watch.
- The real deal.

288
00:15:03,960 --> 00:15:06,280
You see, a newborn's first word is "mama,"

289
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:07,600
but for us, it's...

290
00:15:07,600 --> 00:15:10,040
- "Goal!"
- "Goal!"

291
00:15:10,040 --> 00:15:12,160
This batch of freshmen sure loves to brag!

292
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:14,920
Is it true that engineering students

293
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:15,520
are your rivals?

294
00:15:15,800 --> 00:15:17,360
Oh, there it is.

295
00:15:19,640 --> 00:15:21,360
What? Why are you looking at me?

296
00:15:22,920 --> 00:15:24,240
It's nothing, really.

297
00:15:24,280 --> 00:15:25,400
When competing in sports,

298
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:27,800
both faculties
always trade first and second place.

299
00:15:28,560 --> 00:15:29,120
So,

300
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:30,640
who's first and who's second?

301
00:15:30,680 --> 00:15:31,640
I'm the first,

302
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:32,600
of course!

303
00:15:32,640 --> 00:15:35,240
- Oh, like we'd ever believe that!
- Expect us to buy that?!

304
00:15:35,280 --> 00:15:35,960
For the likes of you...

305
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:36,440
Hold on.

306
00:15:36,480 --> 00:15:37,840
I'm your senior here.

307
00:15:37,880 --> 00:15:38,800
Yes, Boss.

308
00:15:38,880 --> 00:15:39,840
- Yes, Boss.
- Wait, wait.

309
00:15:39,880 --> 00:15:41,880
- You're not wearing a suit tonight, Boss?
- Let's stop there.

310
00:15:41,920 --> 00:15:43,200
I'm done with that bit.

311
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:45,680
Podduang, can you tell us

312
00:15:45,800 --> 00:15:47,800
how the Faculty King and Queen contest was?

313
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:50,040
Hey, the Faculty King is right here.

314
00:15:50,280 --> 00:15:51,520
Why not just ask him?

315
00:15:51,800 --> 00:15:52,760
Scratch that!

316
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:54,680
Let's ask the Faculty Queen instead.

317
00:15:56,600 --> 00:15:58,600
Why the hell do you even want to know?

318
00:15:58,640 --> 00:15:59,880
You could've asked something else.

319
00:16:14,560 --> 00:16:16,600
[Faculty of Sports and Health Science]

320
00:16:22,920 --> 00:16:24,640
Are you in this section?

321
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:28,120
Yes. Are we in the same section?

322
00:16:30,680 --> 00:16:32,880
I'm Podduang.

323
00:16:33,400 --> 00:16:34,960
And I dunk.

324
00:16:36,520 --> 00:16:37,880
What a show-off.

325
00:16:38,800 --> 00:16:39,680
Dunk is my name...

326
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:40,680
Oh.

327
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:41,880
And what's your name?

328
00:16:43,040 --> 00:16:43,800
Bumm.

329
00:16:44,400 --> 00:16:45,800
You've got such a weird name.

330
00:16:45,800 --> 00:16:47,240
Why the name "Podduang"?

331
00:16:47,560 --> 00:16:50,200
Podduang was an ancient Thai currency.

332
00:16:50,240 --> 00:16:52,360
Sheesh, that's dope!

333
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:54,480
I usually hear names like "Pound,"

334
00:16:54,520 --> 00:16:56,240
"Franc," "Euro," and "Dollar."

335
00:16:56,720 --> 00:16:57,720
The classics.

336
00:16:58,680 --> 00:16:59,600
But...

337
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:02,280
you can just call me "Pod."

338
00:17:02,400 --> 00:17:03,800
No, let's go with "Podduang."

339
00:17:03,800 --> 00:17:04,680
Sounds cute.

340
00:17:08,079 --> 00:17:09,200
How about we...

341
00:17:10,280 --> 00:17:11,200
sit together in the class?

342
00:17:16,839 --> 00:17:18,400
Dunk, which bed do you want?

343
00:17:18,760 --> 00:17:20,040
Any. You choose.

344
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:21,880
Mm...

345
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:23,800
I'll go with this one.

346
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:25,160
- Okay.
- Mm-hm.

347
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:28,480
When will we get rid of
the aggressive orientation traditions?

348
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:30,840
So fucking boring!

349
00:17:35,840 --> 00:17:36,920
Well...

350
00:17:38,160 --> 00:17:39,840
when you're in your third year,

351
00:17:40,840 --> 00:17:42,520
try to become
the aggressive senior yourself.

352
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:43,960
No way.

353
00:17:44,560 --> 00:17:46,240
Even we're gossiping about them this much.

354
00:17:46,480 --> 00:17:47,680
When I'm in my third year,

355
00:17:48,280 --> 00:17:49,720
I won't be able to take it.

356
00:17:53,040 --> 00:17:53,840
What?

357
00:17:54,560 --> 00:17:55,840
- Why are you smiling?
- Nothing.

358
00:18:17,840 --> 00:18:18,760
Dunk.

359
00:18:19,240 --> 00:18:20,200
Huh?

360
00:18:20,880 --> 00:18:21,960
What's the matter?

361
00:18:22,800 --> 00:18:23,840
You can't sleep?

362
00:18:24,640 --> 00:18:25,440
Yeah.

363
00:18:26,040 --> 00:18:28,240
I'll get used to this place soon, I think.

364
00:18:30,320 --> 00:18:32,320
I usually sleep with a bolster.

365
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:39,440
It's fine.

366
00:18:41,880 --> 00:18:44,440
I have two.

367
00:18:46,440 --> 00:18:47,440
Thank you.

368
00:18:48,120 --> 00:18:49,120
Sweet dreams.

369
00:18:49,800 --> 00:18:51,200
- Good night.
- Let's sleep.

370
00:19:11,120 --> 00:19:13,240
- Andaman!
- Andaman!

371
00:19:13,640 --> 00:19:15,480
- This way.
- Come on, come on.

372
00:19:17,400 --> 00:19:19,360
[Shine, Anda]
[Love Anda]

373
00:19:19,360 --> 00:19:20,440
Thank you, thank you.

374
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:22,400
- Andaman!
- Andaman!

375
00:19:22,440 --> 00:19:23,640
Andaman!

376
00:19:26,800 --> 00:19:27,600
Who's that?

377
00:19:27,640 --> 00:19:30,680
Oh, that's Anda, a newcomer actor

378
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:32,280
and a first-year engineering student.

379
00:19:33,520 --> 00:19:36,240
Jeez, you're not trying to hide it, huh?

380
00:19:36,480 --> 00:19:38,480
What does it have to do with you?

381
00:19:38,840 --> 00:19:39,680
You're flustered...

382
00:19:39,680 --> 00:19:41,480
Podduang, look at her.

383
00:19:41,520 --> 00:19:42,440
Hey!

384
00:19:46,080 --> 00:19:47,400
Look at this.

385
00:19:50,280 --> 00:19:51,440
Am I more handsome than him?

386
00:19:52,680 --> 00:19:53,680
Not at all.

387
00:19:54,600 --> 00:19:56,320
Not true. I'm more handsome.

388
00:20:01,400 --> 00:20:03,200
- Andaman!
- Andaman!

389
00:20:03,240 --> 00:20:04,760
- Right. Thank you.
- Andaman.

390
00:20:26,560 --> 00:20:28,880
That's our Faculty King and Queen!

391
00:20:33,120 --> 00:20:34,120
Hey.

392
00:20:34,440 --> 00:20:36,800
Doesn't it hurt her throat
when May yells at us?

393
00:20:39,240 --> 00:20:39,880
Guys.

394
00:20:40,200 --> 00:20:41,160
I'm on a date now.

395
00:20:41,320 --> 00:20:42,880
Whoa, with who?

396
00:20:43,360 --> 00:20:44,680
Golf, a third-year student.

397
00:20:46,400 --> 00:20:47,560
Seriously?

398
00:20:47,720 --> 00:20:48,800
I'm serious.

399
00:20:50,280 --> 00:20:51,200
Hey...

400
00:20:51,200 --> 00:20:53,320
Come to think of it,
I think May is pretty cute.

401
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:56,240
Guys...

402
00:20:56,960 --> 00:20:58,280
I broke up with Golf.

403
00:20:58,560 --> 00:21:00,280
Hey, it's okay.

404
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:02,120
You still have us.

405
00:21:04,280 --> 00:21:05,440
I'm on a date now.

406
00:21:05,480 --> 00:21:06,280
Congratulations.

407
00:21:06,720 --> 00:21:07,720
Guys!

408
00:21:07,720 --> 00:21:09,280
He told me I'm too manly for him.

409
00:21:10,320 --> 00:21:11,480
I think he's wrong...

410
00:21:11,520 --> 00:21:12,360
Damn it!

411
00:21:12,800 --> 00:21:14,480
Why does it have to be me?!

412
00:21:14,760 --> 00:21:16,240
Burn the bridge. Trust me.

413
00:21:17,440 --> 00:21:19,080
I'm the one who has no time for him?!

414
00:21:19,120 --> 00:21:19,680
Call it quits.

415
00:21:20,800 --> 00:21:22,080
This guy's the one.

416
00:21:22,080 --> 00:21:23,400
He's adorable!

417
00:21:23,440 --> 00:21:25,960
Mm. Congratulations.

418
00:21:26,320 --> 00:21:28,520
I already gave him a black eye.

419
00:21:29,080 --> 00:21:30,400
Great. Leave him.

420
00:21:32,280 --> 00:21:32,960
Mm.

421
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:33,920
Guys...

422
00:21:42,920 --> 00:21:43,360
Look.

423
00:21:43,360 --> 00:21:44,400
Look at her pretending to be asleep?

424
00:21:46,520 --> 00:21:48,840
Bumm is living her life to the fullest, huh?

425
00:21:49,320 --> 00:21:50,120
Mm.

426
00:21:51,800 --> 00:21:52,480
Podduang.

427
00:21:53,040 --> 00:21:53,480
Hm?

428
00:21:54,160 --> 00:21:55,400
Do you find Bumm cute?

429
00:22:02,960 --> 00:22:05,040
Are you saying...

430
00:22:05,360 --> 00:22:07,280
I don't know. Just forget it.

431
00:22:07,760 --> 00:22:09,160
You sleep on my bed.

432
00:22:09,160 --> 00:22:10,400
I'll sleep on the floor tonight.

433
00:22:53,280 --> 00:22:54,600
What are you doing here all alone?

434
00:22:57,200 --> 00:22:59,400
Isn't this the final day
of your faculty's orientation?

435
00:22:59,440 --> 00:23:01,960
Mm, I just want some peace.

436
00:23:03,160 --> 00:23:04,400
It's loud back there.

437
00:23:05,960 --> 00:23:08,120
And why did you follow me here?

438
00:23:08,920 --> 00:23:11,600
Did I? I was jogging after practice.

439
00:23:11,760 --> 00:23:13,280
Other people jog here, too.

440
00:23:15,800 --> 00:23:16,640
Can I sit with you?

441
00:23:24,720 --> 00:23:26,720
Your faculty is very lively this year.

442
00:23:27,440 --> 00:23:28,560
It's always been like this.

443
00:23:32,040 --> 00:23:32,680
What's wrong?

444
00:23:33,280 --> 00:23:34,320
You always look so upset.

445
00:23:35,160 --> 00:23:36,360
I'm always like this.

446
00:23:39,880 --> 00:23:41,560
You'd usually smile more.

447
00:23:43,640 --> 00:23:44,840
You say that

448
00:23:45,160 --> 00:23:47,080
as if you're always with me.

449
00:23:49,320 --> 00:23:50,720
Well, I do see you from time to time.

450
00:23:51,720 --> 00:23:53,280
I rarely get to see you

451
00:23:53,680 --> 00:23:55,080
outside of Sports Day.

452
00:23:56,360 --> 00:23:57,320
Yeah.

453
00:23:58,920 --> 00:24:00,400
Even back there,

454
00:24:01,120 --> 00:24:02,680
you Bummped into me and ran off.

455
00:24:03,400 --> 00:24:05,400
I almost couldn't remember who it was.

456
00:24:06,640 --> 00:24:07,760
Right, I'm sorry!

457
00:24:08,040 --> 00:24:08,840
Is that enough?

458
00:24:09,840 --> 00:24:11,280
I wasn't mad about that.

459
00:24:20,560 --> 00:24:21,480
Hey.

460
00:24:23,840 --> 00:24:25,560
You should apply to be a trainee
for the soccer club.

461
00:24:26,560 --> 00:24:28,440
The team really needs extra hands.

462
00:24:34,120 --> 00:24:35,280
It's your choice.

463
00:24:36,280 --> 00:24:37,680
I just wanted to invite you.

464
00:24:38,600 --> 00:24:39,920
You love seeing Dunk practice, don't you?

465
00:24:55,920 --> 00:24:56,560
Hey, Jinna.

466
00:24:56,960 --> 00:24:58,360
Check the valve clearance

467
00:24:58,360 --> 00:25:00,360
and see if it's 0.15 mm.

468
00:25:12,600 --> 00:25:15,160
Yeah, the valve clearance is too wide.

469
00:25:15,440 --> 00:25:18,000
No wonder it sounded louder
than rock music during testing.

470
00:25:18,480 --> 00:25:20,080
- Tod, are you free?
- Mm.

471
00:25:20,440 --> 00:25:21,600
Help me check other parts.

472
00:25:27,120 --> 00:25:28,320
Hey, you two,

473
00:25:29,320 --> 00:25:30,640
can we do this later?

474
00:25:31,040 --> 00:25:32,360
I'm hungry.

475
00:25:32,920 --> 00:25:33,960
Damn it, Art.

476
00:25:33,960 --> 00:25:35,960
When are you going to
work on this if not now?

477
00:25:36,280 --> 00:25:39,520
It won't be just the three of us
in the afternoon when Anda joins.

478
00:25:39,520 --> 00:25:41,040
There'll be, like, dozens more.

479
00:25:42,400 --> 00:25:43,680
It's nice that he'll be here, isn't it?

480
00:25:43,960 --> 00:25:44,600
Mm.

481
00:25:44,600 --> 00:25:45,960
Don't you miss him or what?

482
00:25:45,960 --> 00:25:47,560
How often do we get to
see him in a month?

483
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:49,080
Though...

484
00:25:49,440 --> 00:25:51,240
I think having a celebrity
as a friend is pretty cool.

485
00:25:51,600 --> 00:25:52,800
All eyes are always on us.

486
00:25:52,800 --> 00:25:54,960
The Communication Arts girls...

487
00:25:56,400 --> 00:25:57,240
Jeez...

488
00:25:57,280 --> 00:25:58,400
They weren't looking at you.

489
00:25:58,440 --> 00:25:59,560
They were looking at our friend.

490
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:00,760
You rat!

491
00:26:00,760 --> 00:26:02,400
Want a wrench for breakfast?

492
00:26:02,440 --> 00:26:04,440
Hey, enough already, you two.

493
00:26:04,680 --> 00:26:06,320
You're already fighting at this hour.

494
00:26:06,320 --> 00:26:07,840
Let's grab some food.

495
00:26:10,080 --> 00:26:12,560
- Andaman!
- Andaman!

496
00:26:12,560 --> 00:26:15,000
- Andaman.
- Andaman.

497
00:26:15,040 --> 00:26:16,160
Andaman.

498
00:26:16,600 --> 00:26:17,640
Thank you.

499
00:26:18,800 --> 00:26:20,920
You look very handsome in person.

500
00:26:20,920 --> 00:26:21,640
Thank you very much.

501
00:26:21,680 --> 00:26:23,520
Can you tell the fans
watching the livestream

502
00:26:23,560 --> 00:26:27,000
what you and your characters
have in common?

503
00:26:27,400 --> 00:26:29,400
Well, we actually have a lot in common.

504
00:26:29,440 --> 00:26:31,760
My character in the series is
wholesome and romantic,

505
00:26:32,600 --> 00:26:34,840
which is kind of like me in real life.

506
00:26:34,880 --> 00:26:37,080
Is it tough to study Engineering?

507
00:26:37,120 --> 00:26:38,560
Can you tell the younger fans

508
00:26:38,600 --> 00:26:40,320
who may want to study here?

509
00:26:42,040 --> 00:26:43,840
I don't think it's hard.

510
00:26:43,840 --> 00:26:45,840
If I can do well, then so can you.

511
00:26:46,160 --> 00:26:46,760
Oh, excellent!

512
00:26:46,800 --> 00:26:48,280
And more importantly,

513
00:26:48,320 --> 00:26:49,920
I've got friends helping me.

514
00:26:50,240 --> 00:26:52,560
- Art, Jinna, and Tod.
- Huh?

515
00:26:52,600 --> 00:26:54,200
Shit! He's calling us.

516
00:26:55,680 --> 00:26:56,320
Hello.

517
00:26:56,360 --> 00:26:57,800
This is Jinna, Tod,

518
00:26:57,800 --> 00:26:58,920
- and Art.
- Hey...

519
00:26:59,080 --> 00:27:01,320
Anda looks lovely in this outfit.

520
00:27:02,200 --> 00:27:03,840
You're all good-looking here.

521
00:27:04,160 --> 00:27:06,320
Can you promote the series for us?

522
00:27:09,320 --> 00:27:10,440
Absolutely. Please...

523
00:27:10,480 --> 00:27:12,640
Jinna is pretty handsome, actually.

524
00:27:12,720 --> 00:27:14,960
What? Are you having another bias?

525
00:27:15,200 --> 00:27:16,600
Or maybe it's you.

526
00:27:17,160 --> 00:27:19,360
Whatever you hate, you will...

527
00:27:19,400 --> 00:27:20,200
Hate it even more.

528
00:27:20,240 --> 00:27:21,680
- Thank you to the Andaman fandom
- Sure.

529
00:27:21,680 --> 00:27:22,960
for being here today.

530
00:27:24,520 --> 00:27:25,800
The photos are so lovely.

531
00:27:26,040 --> 00:27:27,240
I'm so happy.

532
00:27:27,520 --> 00:27:28,960
Where are you guys from, by the way?

533
00:27:29,720 --> 00:27:32,560
Anda, it's my friend's birthday today.

534
00:27:35,680 --> 00:27:37,440
Happy birthday, Podduang.

535
00:27:37,560 --> 00:27:39,760
I remember you two. Podduang and Bumm.

536
00:27:41,680 --> 00:27:43,320
Thanks, Anda. I...

537
00:27:43,680 --> 00:27:46,320
Can I take selfies with you?

538
00:27:46,320 --> 00:27:48,400
- Sure thing.
- Hey, let me join in, too.

539
00:27:55,440 --> 00:27:56,960
- Thank you.
- Thank you so much.

540
00:27:57,000 --> 00:27:57,880
See you around.

541
00:27:57,920 --> 00:27:58,680
Oh, thank you.

542
00:27:58,680 --> 00:28:00,200
- Anda...
- Thank you, everyone.

543
00:28:00,520 --> 00:28:02,160
Thank you for coming.

544
00:28:02,200 --> 00:28:04,320
Thank you, thank you.

545
00:28:04,840 --> 00:28:06,440
Right. Thank you.

546
00:28:07,000 --> 00:28:09,520
- Can I take selfies with you?
- Yes, yes.

547
00:28:12,040 --> 00:28:13,600
Thank you!

548
00:28:13,960 --> 00:28:15,960
Please, everyone.

549
00:28:16,320 --> 00:28:17,920
My team and I

550
00:28:17,960 --> 00:28:19,920
have been working
really hard on this series.

551
00:28:19,920 --> 00:28:20,840
That's right.

552
00:28:20,840 --> 00:28:22,040
We've been working long and hard.

553
00:28:22,040 --> 00:28:22,800
It's exhausting for me.
How about you?

554
00:28:22,840 --> 00:28:23,480
It really is.

555
00:28:23,480 --> 00:28:25,080
This is our third series now.

