708
00:38:57,760 --> 00:38:59,760
Put your names in the sports
you're interested in.

709
00:39:08,040 --> 00:39:08,920
Lots of students, huh?

710
00:39:08,960 --> 00:39:11,200
Yeah, there are so many students here.

711
00:39:12,640 --> 00:39:13,640
How are you doing?

712
00:39:13,640 --> 00:39:14,520
Hungover, obviously.

713
00:39:14,760 --> 00:39:16,440
